d explore a network of secret caves. You may stumble upon precious gems and mine ores which you can utilize to upgrade and improve your tools. If you dare to visit deeper into the mines, you may discover rare resources. What treasures will you bring home?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586340/extras/e76ef8ad50ac5ae303ee0792b2dff3f4.poster.avif?t=1713806565\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586340/extras/e76ef8ad50ac5ae303ee0792b2dff3f4.webm?t=1713806565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586340/extras/e76ef8ad50ac5ae303ee0792b2dff3f4.mp4?t=1713806565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Fishing</strong><br><br>Some days are meant for hard work while others call for a bit of leisure. What better way to relax than to take your beloved pet out for a fishing trip? Omoide Island has a variety of water sources that yield different fish, so feel free to explore and catch them all! Don\u2019t forget to continuously upgrade your fishing rod to tackle bigger and rarer fish.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586340/extras/fefdc7cefe687269999e76230b7c3c27.poster.avif?t=1713806565\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586340/extras/fefdc7cefe687269999e76230b7c3c27.webm?t=1713806565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586340/extras/fefdc7cefe687269999e76230b7c3c27.mp4?t=1713806565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586340/extras/1d38fd3000dd48a94bc1bb93bf2081ec.avif?t=1713806565\" width=680 height=144 /></span><br><br><strong>Relationships</strong><br><br>You don\u2019t have to be isolated on your farm, feel free to speak with and befriend the townsfolk. You may have items to trade with those in town, or perhaps you just wish to visit. Every island resident has a unique personality and backstory - it\u2019s up to you to learn all about them!<br><br>By completing side quests for your neighbors, you may fetch a better buying and selling price or unlock special rewards. Friendship may even turn into romance when you least expect it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586340/extras/8f32265cf2da1e914858a778263a13a2.poster.avif?t=1713806565\" width=544 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586340/extras/8f32265cf2da1e914858a778263a13a2.webm?t=1713806565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586340/extras/8f32265cf2da1e914858a778263a13a2.mp4?t=1713806565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Quests</strong><br><br>The residents of Omoide Island will need help on occasion. If someone is in need, you can view their request on the bulletin board in town or you may receive a letter directly. Don\u2019t worry if you are busy with another task as side quests and missions are optional.<br><br>Currently, there are two types of quests available: the main quest linked directly to your character\u2019s storyline and optional side quests. The former will lead your character to uncover their forgotten memories and answer the question: what happened before arriving on the island? The latter quests will allow you to improve your relationships and unlock unique items that cannot otherwise be crafted. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586340/extras/a7f1fa665726e7eb33fd45b278f97687.avif?t=1713806565\" width=680 height=144 /></span><br><br>What is life without a furry companion at your side? Pets are, and will always be, your most loyal companions. Explore Omoide Island together, give them endless pets, and play until the sun sets. Your pet, aside from keeping you company, can also assist with farming duties. <br><br><strong>Pets Currently Available:</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586340/extras/462d609b47aca21eff35c793fe5e449a.avif?t=1713806565\" width=556 height=208 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586340/extras/8bc60d7aa19853d9786a2b7813a9a214.avif?t=1713806565\" width=556 height=208 /></span><br><br><strong>Animals</strong><br><br>In addition to planting and managing your crops, you can also raise farm animals. Care for your adorable neighbors with feeding, grooming, cleaning, and - of course - plenty of petting! Your animals love to be showered with affection and, in return, will yield a variety of important resources such as milk, eggs, wool, and feathers.<br><br>If you have animals of different genders in the same barn or coop, they may even make a family of their own.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586340/extras/5af87d1c26e1d3ca4dd226057ae0bf05.poster.avif?t=1713806565\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586340/extras/5af87d1c26e1d3ca4dd226057ae0bf05.webm?t=1713806565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586340/extras/5af87d1c26e1d3ca4dd226057ae0bf05.mp4?t=1713806565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586340/extras/825477f2d83199a7e50c60f5154cba29.avif?t=1713806565\" width=680 height=144 /></span><br><br><strong>Character Customization</strong><br><br>If you ever feel the need to upgrade your look, spice things up by altering your wardrobe or hair. You have the full ability to customize your character by switching hairstyles, eye and skin color, and clothing. Looking for a new outfit? Different clothing can be found all around Omoide Island!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586340/extras/c82c327a842400110ab4fe236a9f1c0d.poster.avif?t=1713806565\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586340/extras/c82c327a842400110ab4fe236a9f1c0d.webm?t=1713806565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586340/extras/c82c327a842400110ab4fe236a9f1c0d.mp4?t=1713806565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Home and Base Customization</strong><br><br>Your home is where you relax and unwind after a long day\u2019s work. Upgrade your space to have everything from a larger interior to new and decorative furniture. Take it a step further and customize your farm by having full control over barn placement, coops, fences, and more!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586340/extras/5ebb35e3e3622cc443f31bb0051af630.poster.avif?t=1713806565\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586340/extras/5ebb35e3e3622cc443f31bb0051af630.webm?t=1713806565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586340/extras/5ebb35e3e3622cc443f31bb0051af630.mp4?t=1713806565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","developers":["Hidden Tower Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1586340/header.jpg?t=1713806565","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1586340/616338/69dcf8a6b9d5ba15bff02008479a6f0342072540/1751008243/dash_av1.mpd?t=1696859477","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1586340/616338/69dcf8a6b9d5ba15bff02008479a6f0342072540/1751008243/dash_h264.mpd?t=1696859477","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1586340/616338/69dcf8a6b9d5ba15bff02008479a6f0342072540/1751008243/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1696859477","id":256974576,"name":"Promo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256974576/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1696859477"}],"name":"A New Leaf: Memories","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"A New Leaf: Memories - $14.99 USD","packageid":561598,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":1499}],"title":"Buy A New Leaf: Memories"}],"packages":[561598],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows